  "description": "Transparent large-message handling for Cloudstrap.Messaging: message bodies over a size threshold are stored in a dedicated Azure Blob Storage container while only a reference travels through the transport, and handlers see the whole message. Account and credential come from the host's registered blob client; one builder call, no contract changes.",
